T09 picker design comparison, each frame is exactly 80x24

A keeps both levels visible, but truncates command and cwd at the target size.
B adds one Enter/Esc step and gives session metadata the full terminal width. CHOSEN.
C minimizes navigation, but mixes host actions with sessions and obscures hierarchy.

